---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
import CTABand from '../components/CTABand.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Deft — pricing, plans, and the private beta"
  description="Three tiers. Beta access, early access, enterprise. Tell us what you wish your tools knew about you."
>

  <!-- ================================================================
       1. SUBPAGE HERO
       ================================================================ -->
  <div class="relative">
    <div class="hero-bloom" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center pt-24 pb-16 relative px-6">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Pricing</p>
      <h1 class="display mb-6">Join the private beta.</h1>
      <p class="lede mx-auto max-w-[600px]">
        Deft is launching with the first ~50 teams that want AI to actually understand
        their work. Pricing locks in for everyone in the beta cohort.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ================================================================
       2. THREE PRICING TIERS
       ================================================================ -->
  <section id="tiers" class="py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-6">

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">

        <!-- Beta -->
        <Card variant="default" lift>
          <div slot="header">
            <p class="eyebrow mb-2">Beta</p>
            <p class="text-[28px] font-bold text-ink leading-tight mb-1">Free</p>
            <p class="text-[13px] text-ink-variant">During private beta · For the first cohort</p>
          </div>

          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 mt-2">
            {[
              'Up to 25 seats',
              'Defty + bring-your-own agents',
              'All native integrations',
              'BSL 1.1 self-host or hosted by us',
              'Direct line to the team building it',
            ].map((item) => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-ink-variant">
                <svg class="flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 w-4 h-4 text-[color:var(--status-green)]" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M3 8l3.5 3.5L13 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>

          <div slot="footer">
            <a
              href="#waitlist"
              class="inline-flex w-full h-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-ghost px-5 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-variant transition-colors hover:border-ink-outline hover:text-ink"
            >
              Request access →
            </a>
          </div>
        </Card>

        <!-- Early access (recommended) -->
        <Card variant="default" lift class="relative">
          <div class="absolute top-3 right-3 px-2 py-0.5 bg-primary-container text-primary-on-container text-[11px] rounded-full font-medium">
            Most teams pick this
          </div>

          <div slot="header">
            <p class="eyebrow mb-2">Early access</p>
            <p class="text-[28px] font-bold text-ink leading-tight mb-1">Custom</p>
            <p class="text-[13px] text-ink-variant">For teams scaling past the cohort</p>
          </div>

          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 mt-2">
            {[
              'Up to 250 seats',
              'Priority support window',
              'Custom skills and capability packs',
              'Per-org spend caps configurable',
              'Onboarding session with the team',
            ].map((item) => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-ink-variant">
                <svg class="flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 w-4 h-4 text-[color:var(--status-green)]" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M3 8l3.5 3.5L13 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>

          <div slot="footer">
            <a
              href="#waitlist"
              class="inline-flex w-full h-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary-container px-5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-on-container shadow-sm transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"
            >
              Talk to us →
            </a>
          </div>
        </Card>

        <!-- Enterprise -->
        <Card variant="default" lift>
          <div slot="header">
            <p class="eyebrow mb-2">Enterprise</p>
            <p class="text-[28px] font-bold text-ink leading-tight mb-1">Custom</p>
            <p class="text-[13px] text-ink-variant">For larger orgs with custom asks</p>
          </div>

          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 mt-2">
            {[
              'Unlimited seats',
              'SSO / SAML / SCIM',
              'Custom data residency',
              'Dedicated infrastructure (your VPC or ours)',
              'Custom MSA, DPA, security review',
            ].map((item) => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-ink-variant">
                <svg class="flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 w-4 h-4 text-[color:var(--status-green)]" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M3 8l3.5 3.5L13 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>

          <div slot="footer">
            <a
              href="mailto:hello@deft.dev"
              class="inline-flex w-full h-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-ghost px-5 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-variant transition-colors hover:border-ink-outline hover:text-ink"
            >
              Contact sales →
            </a>
          </div>
        </Card>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================
       3. WHAT'S INCLUDED IN EVERY TIER
       ================================================================ -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-surface-container-low">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-6">
      <SectionHeader
        eyebrow="Included in every tier"
        title="The whole product. No locked features."
        subtitle="We don't gate the agent. We don't gate the integrations. We don't gate the audit log. The differences between tiers are scale, support, and sovereignty — not features."
        align="center"
      />

      <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:grid-cols-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto">

        <Card variant="subtle">
          <p class="eyebrow mb-1">Agents</p>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-ink-variant">Defty built in. BYOA via MCP. Same approval rails for both.</p>
        </Card>

        <Card variant="subtle">
          <p class="eyebrow mb-1">Integrations</p>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-ink-variant">GitHub, Slack, Google Calendar, Gmail. All included.</p>
        </Card>

        <Card variant="subtle">
          <p class="eyebrow mb-1">Approval rails</p>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-ink-variant">Full three-tier gate. Auto-execute, Quick-approve, Full-review.</p>
        </Card>

        <Card variant="subtle">
          <p class="eyebrow mb-1">Audit trail</p>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-ink-variant">agent_actions, heartbeat turns, circuit-breaker status.</p>
        </Card>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================
       4. WAITLIST FORM
       ================================================================ -->
  <section id="waitlist" class="py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-6">
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto border border-ghost">

        <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Waitlist</p>
        <h2 class="section-title mb-4">Tell us what your team needs.</h2>
        <p class="lede mb-8 max-w-[480px]">
          We read every entry. The most useful ones get a personal reply within 48 hours.
        </p>

        <!-- TODO: wire to /api/waitlist or Resend backend -->
        <form action="/waitlist" method="POST" class="flex flex-col gap-6">

          <!-- Work email -->
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <label for="email" class="eyebrow">Work email</label>
            <input
              id="email"
              name="email"
              type="email"
              required
              placeholder="you@company.com"
              class="bg-surface-container border border-ghost rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-[14px] text-ink w-full focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/30 focus:border-primary/50"
            />
          </div>

          <!-- Team size -->
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <label for="team-size" class="eyebrow">Team size</label>
            <select
              id="team-size"
              name="team_size"
              class="bg-surface-container border border-ghost rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-[14px] text-ink w-full focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/30 focus:border-primary/50"
            >
              <option value="">Select size</option>
              <option value="1">Just me</option>
              <option value="2-10">2–10</option>
              <option value="11-50">11–50</option>
              <option value="51-250">51–250</option>
              <option value="250+">250+</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <!-- What brings you here -->
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <label for="context" class="eyebrow">What brings you here</label>
            <textarea
              id="context"
              name="context"
              rows={4}
              placeholder="What do you wish your tools knew about you?"
              class="bg-surface-container border border-ghost rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-[14px] text-ink w-full focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/30 focus:border-primary/50 resize-none"
            ></textarea>
          </div>

          <button
            type="submit"
            class="inline-flex h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary-container px-6 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-on-container shadow-sm transition-opacity hover:opacity-90 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2"
          >
            Join waitlist
          </button>

        </form>

        <p class="mt-4 text-[12px] text-ink-outline text-center">
          We'll never share your email. You can unsubscribe at any time.
        </p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================
       5. FAQ
       ================================================================ -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-surface-container-low">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-6">
      <SectionHeader
        eyebrow="FAQ"
        title="Quick answers."
        align="center"
      />

      <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 max-w-3xl mx-auto">

        <Card variant="subtle">
          <p class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink mb-2">When does the beta end?</p>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-ink-variant leading-relaxed">
            When we have ~50 teams running production loops. Probably mid-2026. Beta
            pricing locks in for everyone in the cohort — there's no bait-and-switch
            when we move to general availability.
          </p>
        </Card>

        <Card variant="subtle">
          <p class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Can I self-host?</p>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-ink-variant leading-relaxed">
            Yes, today. Docker Compose. The code is on GitHub under BSL 1.1. We host
            it for teams that don't want the ops burden — but production self-hosting
            is explicitly permitted and supported.
          </p>
        </Card>

        <Card variant="subtle">
          <p class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Does it work without AI?</p>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-ink-variant leading-relaxed">
            Yes. Chat, tasks, decisions, and integrations all work without a model in
            the loop. The agent is a feature, not a dependency. If Anthropic's API is
            down, your team still ships.
          </p>
        </Card>

        <Card variant="subtle">
          <p class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink mb-2">What about my data?</p>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-ink-variant leading-relaxed">
            Your data stays in your Postgres. Self-host and we never see it. Hosted with
            us and we never train on it. <code class="font-mono text-[12px] text-primary">org_id</code> isolation
            means no cross-tenant data access — by design, enforced at the schema level.
          </p>
        </Card>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================
       6. CTA BAND
       ================================================================ -->
  <CTABand
    title="Skip the FAQ. Just join."
    cta={{ href: '#waitlist', label: 'Join the waitlist' }}
  />

</Layout>
